```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start[Inbound request]
    Sig{Signature valid?}
    Size{Within size limit?}
    Idem{Idempotency key seen?}
    Extract[Run bounded extraction]
    LLM{Output valid &<br/>confidence >= 0.85?}
    Injection{Injection or<br/>contradiction?}
    CRM[Reconcile CRM]
    Match{Exactly one<br/>match?}
    Policy[Evaluate deterministic policy]
    Approve{Human approval<br/>valid & unexpired?}
    Send[Dispatch with provider idempotency key]
    Provider{Provider response?}
    Done[Terminal success]
    Reject[Reject + audit]
    Duplicate[Return prior outcome]
    Quarantine[Quarantine]
    Retry[Bounded retry]
    DLQ[DLQ + operator replay]
    Replay[Replay after investigation]

    Start --> Sig
    Sig -->|no| Reject
    Sig -->|yes| Size
    Size -->|no| Reject
    Size -->|yes| Idem
    Idem -->|yes| Duplicate
    Idem -->|no| Extract
    Extract --> LLM
    LLM -->|no: schema failure or low confidence| Quarantine
    LLM -->|yes| Injection
    Injection -->|detected| Quarantine
    Injection -->|clean| CRM
    CRM --> Match
    Match -->|zero or multiple| Quarantine
    Match -->|one| Policy
    Policy -->|requires HITL| Approve
    Policy -->|spam| Quarantine
    Approve -->|no / expired / replayed| Quarantine
    Approve -->|yes| Send
    Send --> Provider
    Provider -->|2xx| Done
    Provider -->|timeout or 5xx| Retry
    Retry -->|attempts remain| Send
    Retry -->|exhausted| DLQ
    DLQ -->|controlled replay| Replay
    Replay --> Idem

    Reject -.->|append event| Done
    Duplicate -.->|append event| Done
    Quarantine -.->|append event| Done
    DLQ -.->|append event| Done

    classDef normal fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#475569,color:#111827
    classDef decision fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111827
    classDef failure fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#111827
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#111827

    class Start,Extract,CRM,Policy,Send,Replay normal
    class Sig,Size,Idem,LLM,Injection,Match,Approve,Provider,Retry decision
    class Reject,Duplicate,Quarantine,DLQ failure
    class Done terminal
```
